WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.300
-Also, I should mention my holiday single

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.534
is released today.

00:00:05.534 --> 00:00:08.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.801 --> 00:00:12.133
It's called "Almost Too Early for Christmas."

00:00:12.133 --> 00:00:13.534
-Almost.

00:00:13.534 --> 00:00:15.300
-It's "Almost Too Early for Christmas."

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.667
Me and -- The great Dolly Parton helped me out

00:00:17.667 --> 00:00:20.300
and made the song actually listenable.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:22.534
It's fantastic. She's great.

00:00:22.534 --> 00:00:24.033
And I just want to say thank you to Dolly

00:00:24.033 --> 00:00:25.601
and thank you to everyone out there

00:00:25.601 --> 00:00:27.334
who's given me some love on this.

00:00:27.334 --> 00:00:29.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:29.501 --> 00:00:33.634
It's almost -- It's too early for Christmas, this song,

00:00:33.634 --> 00:00:35.467
but it could be used to get in the spirit.

00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:37.567
And everyone wants to get in the spirit, everyone wants to get happy.

00:00:37.567 --> 00:00:41.434
You plan for the holidays, Thanksgiving, or whatever.

00:00:41.434 --> 00:00:44.767
And I was thinking -- this would be great if this could happen.

00:00:44.767 --> 00:00:49.367
I would love this song to be the on-hold waiting music

00:00:49.367 --> 00:00:51.100
for the Butterball Hotline.

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:53.100
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:56.033
So, if anyone out there knows anyone at Butterball...

00:00:56.033 --> 00:00:57.601
-Let's get this done.

00:00:57.601 --> 00:01:00.167
-It's been my dream since I was a child.

00:01:00.167 --> 00:01:02.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.567
-To get your song on the hold music at the Butterball Hotline?

00:01:06.567 --> 00:01:08.033
That's been your dream since a child.

00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:10.234
-Yeah, I was a little child, and I would just dream about --

00:01:10.234 --> 00:01:11.734
-How old? How old was this child period?

00:01:11.734 --> 00:01:14.367
-Probably like... -29, 30?

00:01:14.367 --> 00:01:17.267
-30-year-old child, and I go, "I want to be the hold music

00:01:17.267 --> 00:01:18.901
for the Butterball Hotline."

00:01:18.901 --> 00:01:20.634
-Right. -'Cause everyone's calling.

00:01:20.634 --> 00:01:22.634
They want to know how to make their food or whatever.

00:01:22.634 --> 00:01:24.834
Any tips you want, you call the Butterball Hotline.

00:01:24.834 --> 00:01:27.067
And I would just -- I was --

00:01:27.067 --> 00:01:29.601
If you can -- A kid can dream.

00:01:29.601 --> 00:01:31.767
-Right. That's what you want for Christmas.

00:01:31.767 --> 00:01:33.934
-I was that little -- I was that little Butterball.

00:01:33.934 --> 00:01:35.601
-Aww.

00:01:35.601 --> 00:01:37.400
-They used to call me Butterball Boy.

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:39.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.133 --> 00:01:40.868
Thank you.

00:01:40.868 --> 00:01:42.634
Butterball, if you're listening, I'd appreciate it.

